Data sources
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Orbital elements are retrieved at runtime from CelesTrak (https://celestrak.org),
asteroid close approaches from NASA/JPL's Small-Body Database
(https://ssd-api.jpl.nasa.gov), and the meteor shower almanac is derived from
the International Meteor Organization's published shower calendar
(https://www.imo.net). None of this data is redistributed in this repository;
see docs/third-party/ for the provenance of every figure that is.
